Meno siete:
    TOF_PN_5s

Komentár:
    Timer to off, simple version.
    Input in=1 activates output, input in=0 starts a 5s countdown.
    After 5s without in=1 the output turns off.

Vstupy:
    in

Výstupy:
    out

Premenné:
    int timeout = 5000

Miesta (počiatočné tokeny, voliteľne akcie):
    IDLE (1) pos: 80,80
    ACTIVE (0) pos: 280,80
    TIMING (0) pos: 480,80
    P4 (0) pos: 655,0

Prechody a ich podmienky:
T_on pos: 180,220 :
    in:  IDLE*1
    out: ACTIVE*1
    when: in [ atoi(valueof("in")) == 1 ]
    do: {  }

T_off_start pos: 380,220 :
    in:  ACTIVE*1
    out: TIMING*1
    when: in [ atoi(valueof("in")) == 0 ]
    do: {  }

T_cancel_off pos: 380,80 :
    in:  TIMING*1
    out: ACTIVE*1
    when: in [ atoi(valueof("in")) == 1 ]
    do: {  }

T_timeout_off pos: 580,220 :
    in:  TIMING*1
    out: IDLE*1
    when:  @ timeout
    do: {  }

T5 pos: 269,-80 :
    in:  
    out: 
    when: 
    do: {  }

